Revision history for Game-Brandubh

0.03    2026-10-13
        - Add options, the fields a launcher offers before a game
        - The keys, the screen and the opening questions are Game::Terminal::Kit's
        - Requires perl 5.14
        - NO_COLOR=0 turns colour off; shift-tab, home and end work in the opening questions, the digits no longer do
        - Between two squares equally near, an arrow takes the one straighter ahead
        - as_text writes a waiting draw offer and the attackers at p2, and from_text reads them back
        - u undoes and r redoes a turn, through Game::Terminal::Kit::History; the rules key is now R

0.02    2026-10-11
        - Add Game::Brandubh::Terminal->run(@argv), which returns the exit status

0.01    2026-10-09
        - First version.
